  "notes": "Editorial release-desk tool for a state labor-market jobs report. Distinctive: dark teal top bar with two countdown tiles (embargo tile outlined in amber); status pills with coloured dots double as jump-to buttons (clicking jumps to first chart with that status, not a filter); every sidebar item cross-links to a chart; revised data point drawn in burnt orange with dashed outline; uppercase tracked section labels on white bordered panels over a light grey canvas; disabled actions carry an explanation line ('Lift every disclosure hold before release.'). Role-gated actions (Lead only, reviewer-only Place hold). Activity log entries have colour-coded left rules by event type. Detail layout varies by chart type (line chart, suppressed-cell table with hatched cells) and shows inline warning banners for re-check/hold states."
}
